### 1. CHAT con Llama 3.3 70b (via RapidAPI - open-ai21)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ia/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "prompt": "Explain what is reactive programming in one paragraph."
}

###

### 2. TRADUCIR texto (Deep Translate - en -> es)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ia/translate?source=en&target=es
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "prompt": "Hello World."
}

###

### 3. TRADUCIR texto (Deep Translate - detección automática -> fr)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ia/translate?target=fr
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "prompt": "Good morning, how are you?"
}
